      raw_text: "WHEN: Fight step of your opponent's Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has resolved its attacks. TARGET: One friendly unit eligible to fight. EFFECT: Until the end of the phase your unit has the Fights First ability, and it must be the next unit you select to fight."
