      raw_text: "EMPEROR\u2019S CHILDREN model only. You can re-roll Battle-shock and Leadership tests taken for the bearer\u2019s unit. While the bearer\u2019s unit is your army\u2019s Favoured Champions, add 1 to the Objective Control characteristic of models in that unit."
