      raw_text: "Packing together within the confines of cover might work against small arms, but in the face of Dominus-class Knights, it only serves to concentrate and magnify the fury of their firepower.\n\nFriendly IMPERIAL KNIGHTS DOMINUS units' attacks that target a unit in a terrain area have +1 to hit rolls."
