      raw_text: "At the start of your Command phase, select one MONSTER, VEHICLE or CHARACTER unit from your opponent\u2019s army. Until the start of your next Command phase, that enemy unit is your Prey: Each time a BEAST SNAGGA unit from your army declares a charge that includes your Prey as one of the targets, you can re-roll the Charge roll. Each time a BEAST SNAGGA model from your army makes an attack that targets your Prey, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
